WEBVTT

00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:32.067
Dikkens ijodi shu qadar o’ziga xoski, 
bejizga “dikkenscha uslub” atamasi

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:36.879
paydo bo'lmagan. Ammo muallif 
uslubining o'ziga xosligi nimada?

00:00:36.879 --> 00:00:39.528
Dikkens nasri oldindan sezish,
qayg’uli sahnalar, voqea-

00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:43.539
larning kutilmaganda burilish yasashi va 
jumboqli vaziyatlar bilan ajralib turadi.

00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:46.938
Bu xususiyatlarning barchasi 
kitobxonlar e'tiborini tortadi.

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:50.286
Uning dastlabki hikoyalari arzon 
adabiy jurnallarda

00:00:50.286 --> 00:00:55.515
bobma-bob chop etilgan, 
keyinchalik esa

00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:58.621
alohida kitob shaklida nashr etilgan.

00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:01.621
Odamlar u asar qanday 
yakun topishini oldindan bilib,